g r a p h i c a l a b s t r a c t
Mixed ligands Cu-metal organic frameworks (MOFs) were designed, synthesized, and well characterized. By virtue of their porosity, practical applications of the mixed ligands MOFs as the transport vehicles for the delivery of ibuprofen and doxorubicin hydrochloride, and the pH controlled release were investigated.
